{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38560","headline":"红叶 · 吴融","name":"红叶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露染霜乾片片轻，斜阳照处转烘明。\n和烟飘落九秋色，随浪泛将千里情。\n几夜月中藏鸟影，谁家庭际伴蛩声。\n一时衰飒无多恨，看着清风彩剪成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「红叶」条，撰者秦岭梅、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"秦岭梅"}